android/app/google-services.json
ios/Runner/GoogleService-Info.plist

# Agent run logs and generated skill files
data/run-logs/
SKILL.md
.claude/
.clone/worktrees/
.agent/

# Exceptions (force-added, version-controlled): load-bearing agent tooling whose
# discipline is referenced by CLAUDE.md (The Gate / Memory). Tracked despite the
# .claude/ and SKILL.md blanket-ignores above:
#   .claude/skills/run-the-gate/{SKILL.md,reviewer-prompt.md}
#   .claude/skills/automerge/{SKILL.md,diff-reviewer-prompt.md}
#   .claude/workflows/verified-sweep.js
# settings.local.json, scheduled_tasks.lock, worktrees/ stay ignored.

